@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### Catálogos reales de almacenes y familias IFAMB
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family/options

### México con resguardos al 31 de agosto 2026, desde el inicio del Auxiliar
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-08-31&warehouse=01&family=all&scope=branch&includeUndated=false

### Familia B008 TSC en México
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-09-30&warehouse=01&family=B008

### Todos los almacenes; unidades separadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-09-30&warehouse=all&family=all

### Familia no asignada (valor vacío)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-09-30&warehouse=01&family=

### Fecha imposible: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-02-30&warehouse=01

### México con resguardos, TCC; incluye todos los pendientes sin fecha como escenario estimado
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-08-31&warehouse=01&family=B007&scope=branch&includeUndated=true

### Sólo almacén físico 01, sin resguardos
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-08-31&warehouse=01&family=B007&scope=warehouse&includeUndated=false

### Resguardo 15 individual
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-08-31&warehouse=15&family=B007&scope=warehouse&includeUndated=false

### Booleano ambiguo: 400, no se convierte la cadena false a true
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventories/reports/by-family?asOf=2026-08-31&includeUndated=1
